WEBVTT

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.990
<i>I can't believe even the class rep 
found out Shiragami's secret.</i>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.010
<i>Of course, we found out the class 
rep's secret at the same time...</i>

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.660
<i>Anyway, if I'm going to protect these secrets,</i>

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.390
<i>I need to avoid </i>her<i> at all costs.</i>

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.630
Please, stop!

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.080
You won't gain anything by doing this.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.920
I don't care, just talk.

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.400
H-He had his reasons.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.480
He went for it, but then he got friendzo—

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.870
No, it's nothing, really.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.600
Not that we need to answer.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:45.170
Oh? If you refuse to be interviewed,

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.720
I do have some ideas of my own.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:54.990
I could put embarrassing photos 
of you in my newspaper.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.310
Behold, the peeing fountains!

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.120
Please, no!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:05.650
Don't worry, though. 
You won't be on the front page.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.250
Right, Asahi?

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.410
<i>She's the president of the Newspaper Club,</i>

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.340
<i>#1 in the schoolwide heathen ranking,</i>

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:17.090
<b>Newspaper
Club President</b>

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.610
<i>and the Heathen Queen:</i>

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.090
<b>Schoolwide Heathen Ranking #1!</b>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.090
<b>Heathen Queen</b>

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.090
<b>Akemi Mikan</b>

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.090
<i>Akemi Mikan!</i>

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.010
Th-The horror!

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:25.060
How could you fill the newspaper 
with scandal gossip?

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:29.620
It's because you like seeing 
people suffer, isn't it?

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.110
Although, he's pretty much your top victim.

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.280
Morning, Asahi.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:37.660
Wh-What is it, Mikan?

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:41.560
Interviewing your friends 
isn't getting me anywhere.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.910
As a favor to your childhood friend,
I'd like you to tell me...

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:49.190
<i>Everyone else is gone, right, Kuromine-kun?</i>

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.420
<i>Yeah, Shiragami.</i>

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.800
That's all I got, but...

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.880
What's your relationship 
with Shiragami Youko-san?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.390
What?!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:37.020
<b>Beware
Childhood Friends!</b>

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.450
Beware Childhood Friends!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.690
Stop right there!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.990
Just be good and take my interview, Asahi!

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.990
Hell, no!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.330
<b>Scoop!</b>

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.330
Asahi's Bedwetting 
Makes a Map to Atlantis

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.330
That time when I wet my 
bed in grade school...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.830
Kuromine Asahi's
Love Letter of a Lifetime

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:50.830
And the time I wrote my first 
love letter in middle school...

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.750
How much do you think I suffered 
thanks to your newspaper?!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.260
Then you know you can't get away from me!

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.760
Now, settle down and take your interview.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:12.520
So that super-spicy cream puff 
was your doing, Mikan?

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:15.770
Bingo.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.440
<i>Everyone else is gone, right, Kuromine-kun?</i>

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.030
<i>Yeah, Shiragami.</i>

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.340
This is more than enough to ruin you,

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.810
but I really wanted to interview you.

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.330
What did you two do after this?

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.250
N-Nothing.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.840
You're another peeing fountain!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:38.920
Stop it!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:46.180
You'd better fess up if you don't 
want everyone to see this photo!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:49.160
I swear, there's nothing between us!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:52.680
Shiragami and I just... became friends.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.810
Friends, huh?

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:05.780
You're ten billion years too young to try 
to keep secrets from me, you leaky basket!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.600
Well, that's fine. If you don't want to talk, 
I'll just ask Shiragami-san.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.950
W-Wait, Mikan!

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:26.520
<i>Oh, good. Mikan's not here yet.</i>

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.880
<i>If she were to interview Shiragami...</i>

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>I-It can't be...</i>

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.900
Now that I've been outed as a vampire,

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:43.280
I have to leave this school.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.200
Hey, Kuromine, sit down.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.870
S-Sensei.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:53.370
What is it?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.500
Why is Shiragami... 
Why is Shiragami not here?

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.230
Listen, Kuromine.

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:03.630
Listen well.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.590
She just has a cold!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:13.010
Idiots like you don't get colds, 
but everyone else does!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.100
And the whole class agrees?!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.400
Seriously.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:19.400
That aside, are you close with Shiragami?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.310
Well, we're friends.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:24.530
Huh, that's a surprise.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.070
Would you handle this, then?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.520
Stop by Shiragami's place after 
school and give this to her.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.910
Huh? To Shiragami's place?

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.660
Yeah, yeah, I get it. You're happy.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:37.910
Now sit down.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.920
It's not that I'm happy!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.750
Stop right there, Asahi!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.670
Why do you keep following me?!

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.770
Isn't this fun, Asahi?

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.010
This moment when I 
chase you as you resist!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.310
Nothing beats this!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.780
Oh, man.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:58.560
She found him.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.780
Running away won't save you, Asahi!

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.640
Class Rep!

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:07.570
Quiet.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.210
You're too close, Class Rep.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.200
Wh-What?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.620
S-Stay calm, Kuromine Asahi.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.000
I-I'm doing this in order to lose the enemy.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.850
What enemy?

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:22.120
It seems Akemi Mikan has 
been chasing you all day.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.450
Yeah, well...

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.240
So that's what's going on.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.270
I guess I'll have to get 
someone else to go visit her.

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:34.480
It's true that you aren't 
in a relationship with her.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.380
You have nothing to hide.

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.090
But if she makes an article about it,

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.620
Shiragami will get a lot of attention.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:44.690
Besides, if people think she's dating me...

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.890
<i>Jeez, come on.</i>

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.880
<i>Mikan totally shopped that photo.</i>

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:53.370
<i>I'm getting tired of explaining each time.</i>

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.450
<i>Should we just say we're actually dating?</i>

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.010
I-I guess that's not likely.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.570
Then again, according to 
the manga on this world,

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:03.260
a male and female with nothing in their way

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:05.270
are likely to establish a relationship.

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:07.380
What are you talking about, Class Rep?

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:10.550
Found you.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.550
Mikan!

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.220
You're not getting away this time, Asahi.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.220
Leave this to me.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.240
Go!

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.470
Class Rep, but...

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:24.230
A mission should be carried out by 
none but the one it was given to.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.940
All right.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:26.930
Wait!

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:27.690
Akemi Mikan.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.300
You shall not pass!

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:39.830
Shiragami's place should be around here.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:47.630
There are bats flying all around it...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.880
Huh? Kuromine-kun?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.840
What are you doing there?

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.920
Sh-Shiragami!

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:58.470
Sorry to make you bring that handout.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.860
<i>Sh-Shiragami in pajamas!</i>

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:02.980
<i>That alone makes it worth coming here.</i>

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.310
No reason to stand out here and talk.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.580
Come on in.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:10.420
Huh? No, I gave you the handout. 
I'm going home now.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:13.250
Don't worry about me.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.810
I was all better by this afternoon.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:22.360
Er, I mean, I keep my room clean all the time.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:25.750
I'm totally fine having guests over anytime.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:29.000
<i>Sh-She was cleaning up for me.</i>

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.880
Okay, I guess I'll come in for a little bit.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.310
Yeah? Okay.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.220
Come in, then.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.840
Thanks, I will.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.640
Sh-Shiragami!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.860
Your wings! Your wings!

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:45.660
Huh? Oh, sorry, were they out?

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:46.480
She doesn't care!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.320
Sorry to surprise you.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.980
I get lazy when I'm at home.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.110
I don't mind...

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:00.450
<i>It actually makes me happy to think</i>

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.250
<i>she's okay with showing 
me and not anyone else.</i>

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:08.020
To be honest, I heard from Sensei 
that you were coming over,

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.500
and I got a bit excited.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.200
A-Are you okay?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.730
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.170
So because you knew I was coming, you...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:20.120
Well, ever since I moved out on my own,

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:23.470
I haven't had any friends over.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:24.970
<b>Friend!</b>

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:24.970
Ack!

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:28.550
Yeah, that makes sense.

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:31.480
It would be bad if someone 
found out you were a vampire.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:32.980
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.980
<i>Her room's normal...</i>

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:39.620
It's kind of embarrassing when 
you look around like that.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.030
Oh, sorry.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:44.410
I was just wondering if you 
had a casket or anything.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.620
A casket? Nah, I couldn't afford such a luxury.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.960
<b>For a luxurious
night's rest!!</b>

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.960
That's a luxury?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.440
Anyway, I don't mind you looking,

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:57.120
but don't go around opening things up.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.440
Of course I won't.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.720
Especially not my closet.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:05.000
Of course, I always keep my room clean,

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.140
so it's unlikely, but...

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.780
What if, you know, something 
mysterious happened

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:11.360
and it all came crashing down?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.490
Right?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.650
You jammed it all in there, didn't you?

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:18.370
Then again, that's so you, I guess.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.850
That's so your room, Shiragami.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.280
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:28.020
<i>I'm in Shiragami's... my crush's room!</i>

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:30.660
I'll pour you some tea.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.960
What's wrong, Kuromine-kun?

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.460
Uh... Oh! Nothing.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.260
Kuromine Asahi, this is an emergency!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.840
Class Rep, how do you know my number?

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:47.290
Because I'm the class rep.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:51.690
Never mind that! Akemi Mikan is on
her way to Shiragami Youko's place!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.310
What?!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.770
I apologize. I failed.

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.570
I won't let you pass, Akemi Mikan!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.660
I already know.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.770
He's going to visit Shiragami-san, isn't he?

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.660
Don't you find it suspicious 
that they'll be alone?

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.960
Of course not.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:10.030
I have plans to visit Shiragami Youko, too.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.750
You'd better hurry, then.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:12.410
What?

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:17.910
Think about it. If Asahi gets to 
Shiragami-san's place first,

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:22.550
you'd be intruding in the middle of 
a young couple while they're alone.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:27.550
And you might catch them in the act!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.560
In the act?!

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:40.070
<i>You'll be okay now, Shiragami-san.</i>

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:42.810
<i>Thank you, Kuromine-kun.</i>

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:50.950
No!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:54.420
Kuromine Asahi's mission is to 
hand Shiragami Youko her handout!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.250
There's no way he'd take further actions!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.900
Akemi Mikan confounded me 
with her verbal skills.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.260
This is an unexpected failure!

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.620
All right.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.020
Thanks, Class Rep.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.460
I'll handle it from here.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.010
No! Don't!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:13.520
Shiragami!

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:16.520
What is it, Kuromine Asahi?

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.810
Shiragami!

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.820
A-Are you okay, Shiragami?

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.240
K-Kuromine-kun!

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.540
This isn't what you think!

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.880
She came in just when you went out.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.920
She's... uh... Akemi-san, right?

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:35.580
She came in through the window.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.080
I told her not to!

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.740
A trap. What a classy welcome.

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:45.220
But I will not give up.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:55.020
<b>{aside} Fufufu...</b>

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:55.020
<b>That's... a secret.                                                         Why is it always me?!</b>

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.950
You got me yesterday, but just you wait.

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:10.020
You shouldn't do it, Mikan-san.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.700
You stay out of this!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.950
But...

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.090
There, it's done!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.290
My masterpiece!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:24.130
<b>Hot love
exposed!!</b>

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:24.130
<b>Kuromine Asahi's
sleepover at a
mysterious girl's
lavish home!</b>

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:19.900
"Hot love exposed!"

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:24.130
"Kuromine Asahi's sleepover at a 
mysterious girl's lavish home!"

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.470
Well?

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.050
Nice title, don't you think?

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:29.430
Come on, that's obviously shopped!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.260
The room <i>and</i> the time!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.030
Oh, my, Asahi! Good going!

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.100
I'm not jealous, I swear!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.980
It's pretty well done.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.360
I know, right?

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:40.600
It's no use.

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:42.440
The data's here.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.330
So there you have it.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.690
Keep your eyes open for 
the next school newspaper!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:48.440
Wait!

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.070
Quit making things up, Mikan!

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.070
Those two sure are energetic.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.580
Mikan!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.290
Give me that photo!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.240
I-I touched...

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:07.910
Jeez, be careful.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.220
No running in the hall—

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.130
Sorry, Shiragami.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.890
Just this once, let me run in the hallways.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.600
Did something happen?

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.810
What about a photo?

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:16.390
Huh?

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.650
Nothing!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:21.310
You don't have to worry about it.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.930
Kuromine-kun...

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.000
I, uh...

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.070
Bye!

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:29.080
He's totally lying.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:31.200
Shiragami-san.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.490
Um, Okada-kun?

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.480
Sorry to call you out.

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:39.370
Listen, there's something I wanted to ask you.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.370
Me?

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:45.290
Do you have any idea why
Asahi's acting so desperate?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.840
Okay, thanks, Shiragami-san.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.770
I lost her.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:15:59.770
If I don't find her...

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.440
Seriously, what are you doing?

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.570
Oka.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:06.650
Mikan-chan ran up to the rooftop.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:09.150
Really? Thanks.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:11.120
Oh, also, Asahi,

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:14.690
about Mikan-chan...

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:25.670
Mikan, just...

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.290
how far do you have to run?!

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:34.050
To think you'd chase me all the way here. 
You're getting good, Asahi.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:37.060
By the way, these photos 
would fly pretty far if

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.060
I threw them from here, don't you think?

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.100
Seriously, please.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.530
Don't make an article out of that.

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:49.360
I'll do whatever you say, 
if you let me off the hook.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.830
Why would you say that now?

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.610
That just makes me want to do it even more.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.260
Please, not this time.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:02.000
Seriously, please, don't.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.130
<i>If that article gets out,</i>

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:09.290
<i>the whole school would have 
their eyes on Shiragami.</i>

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:13.040
<i>I finally made friends with Shiragami.</i>

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:17.750
<i>If the article got out, 
Shiragami might quit school.</i>

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.540
<i>Even if she didn't quit, she'd...</i>

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:26.930
<i>She'd be alone again.</i>

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:31.220
<i>She'll be alone in class again,
just to protect her secret.</i>

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.000
You're pretty desperate.

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.650
Normally, you'd give up by now.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.280
Is there really something 
between you and Shiragami-san?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.490
Th-That's not it!

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.290
Please, I'm begging you!

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:48.290
Well, we've known each other for ages.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.000
I don't mind caving, just this once.

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:52.880
Mikan...

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.260
Not!

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.010
Did you think I'd really say that?!

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.800
I was an idiot for believing you.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.600
One look at your face makes it 
obvious, you leaky basket!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.170
What is it you're hiding?

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.810
I'm not hiding anything!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.520
Is it something you can't even 
tell your childhood friend?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.860
Seriously, why is it always
me you have to pick on?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:16.110
The more you resist, Asahi, 
the more powerful I become!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.660
In fact, right now, I 
could fly across the sky!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.540
About Mikan-chan...

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:27.620
She keeps doing it because you resist.

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.210
<i>Because I resist?</i>

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:34.090
That just makes me want to do it even more.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:39.140
<i>Then I only have one choice.</i>

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.390
Mikan.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.310
You can publish that photo.

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:49.510
Write about me and Shiragami all you like.

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.730
I'm happy to be in your newspaper!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.230
Happy!

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:54.730
Happy!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.940
<i>I-It's working?</i>

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.080
Oh, come on, you say that,

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.910
but you really don't want me to, do you?

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.610
No, go ahead.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.500
Go right ahead and publish it.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.620
I'm grateful!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.870
Anything to make you happy!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:15.800
<i>Huh?</i>

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:24.020
Do you think I, the Heathen 
Queen Akemi Mikan,

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:29.640
would write an article that 
would make you happy, Asahi?!

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:33.480
I'll get you for this, you wretched bastard!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.850
Thank God.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.230
She actually listened.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:44.500
Seriously, I told him he 
doesn't have to try so hard.

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:47.990
Kuromine-kun, you idiot.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:52.570
Looks like things worked out.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:54.900
Oka.

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:00.720
I don't think Mikan-chan is 
as heathen as people say.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.220
<b>Newspaper Club exclusive: Kuromine Asahi on a date!!
With the mysterious beauty, Shiragami Youko!</b>

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.220
"Everyone else is gone, right, Kuromine-kun...?"

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.340
Nothing's stopping her from writing the article,

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:09.390
The Newspaper Club has caught Kuromine Asahi on a date with none other than the mysterious beauty, Shiragami Youko! Kuromine Asahi visited Shiragami Youko's home today after school, concerned for her well-being after she took the day off sick. He ran straight to her home after school. Kuromine, evidently being at her place for the first time, behaved nervously, whereas Shiragami was relaxed all throughout. Coming to Shiragami's home created a good opportunity for Kuromine, as she lives alone. The two spent the night together at Shiragami's home. Speculation on what took place there is an exercise for the reader, but it is clear that they are intimate. The newspaper will continue to report further developments on the matter aggressively. Keep your eyes peeled!
Article: Akemi Mikan
*This newspaper is fictional.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.780
yet she comes to you for permission.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:09.390
And she even adds a note saying it's fictional.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.870
Now that you mention it, I guess you're right.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.840
You know, her "heathen" thing 
looks more like an act to me.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.260
What's the matter, Asahi?

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:25.790
Well, if what you're saying is true,

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:30.870
what reason does Mikan have 
for acting so heathen?

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.890
No littering!

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:39.800
Hey, I told you over and over to keep quiet!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.910
I'll crush you!

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:43.010
Ow, that hurts!

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:46.860
Seriously, you're a pair 
of glasses! Stop talking!

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:51.280
But it's all because you took such 
good care of these glasses that I,

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:57.210
Fuku-chan, god of fortune, was able to 
inhabit it the way a tsukumogami would.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.100
God of fortune, my ass!

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:03.200
I can totally talk to my glasses.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.210
I'm beyond weird.

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:07.410
Just accept me already.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.080
That way, I can use my god of fortune 
powers to grant your childhood dream—

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.910
Don't.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:15.890
Just leave things as they are.

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:18.850
I'm the perpetrator, Asahi's the victim.

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:20.620
I like this relationship.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:21.680
But...

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:23.670
It's fine.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.630
So long as I'm such an awful person,

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:30.160
I can stay childhood friends 
with Asahi forever.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:32.180
Don't you think?

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.770
But what you did back there...

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:37.020
Don't you actually...

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.810
You keep quiet!

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.110
Ow, ow!

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:41.410
That hurts!

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:43.230
You're crushing me!

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:46.360
I refuse to believe that a 
pair of glasses could talk!

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:50.500
I'll never believe it!

