Question two: You've peeked at your 
childhood friend taking a bath.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:34.430
<b>Question 2</b>

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:34.430
<b>You've peeked at your
childhood friend taking a bath.</b>

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:34.430
<b>Yes

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:34.430
Like hell!

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:37.840
Question 3: You've gotten turned on by 
your childhood friend and attacked them.

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:41.600
<b>Question 3</b>

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:41.600
<b>You've gotten turned on by your
childhood friend and attacked them.</b>

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:41.600
<b>Yes

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:39.860
Don't use me in these images!

00:23:39.860 --> 00:23:41.600
And now for your results!

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:46.190
<b>Mostly YESes:</b>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:46.190
<b>King of the Heathens!</b>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:46.190
<b>Mosttly NOs:</b>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:46.190
